{"tail":"הַלֲלוּיָהּ הַלֲלוּ אֶת־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מִן־הַשָּׁמַיִם הַלֲלוּהוּ "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n83.jpg","n":"27"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"בַּמְּרוֹמִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/2","n":"2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַלֲלוּהוּ כָל־מַלְאָכָיו הַלֲלוּהוּ כָּל־צְבָאָיו: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/3","n":"3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַלֲלוּהוּ שֶׁמֶשׁ וְיָרֵחַ הַלֲלוּהוּ כָּל־כּוֹכְבֵי אוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/4","n":"4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַלֲלוּהוּ שְׁמֵי הַשָּׁמָיִם וְהַמַּיִם אֲשֶׁר מֵעַל הַשָּׁמָיִם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/5","n":"5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יְהַלֲלוּ אֶת־שֵׁם "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כִּי הוּא צִוָּה וְנִבְרָאוּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/6","n":"6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַיַּעֲמִידֵם לָעַד לְעוֹלָם חָק־נָתַן וְלֹא־יַעֲבוֹר: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/7","n":"7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַלֲלוּ אֶת־"}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" מִן־הָאָרֶץ תַּנִּינִים וְכָל־תְּהֹמוֹת: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/8","n":"8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֵשׁ וּבָרָד שֶׁלֶג וְקִיטוֹר רוּחַ סְעָרָה עֹשָׂה דְבָרוֹ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/9","n":"9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הֶהָרִים וְכָל־גְּבָעוֹת עֵץ פְּרִי וְכָל־אֲרָזִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/10","n":"10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַחַיָּה וְכָל־בְּהֵמָה רֶמֶשׂ וְצִפּוֹר כָּנָף: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/11","n":"11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מַלְכֵי־אֶרֶץ וְכָל־לְאֻמִּים שָׂרִים וְכָל־שֹׁפְטֵי אָרֶץ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/12","n":"12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בַּחוּרִים וְגַם־בְּתוּלוֹת זְקֵנִים עִם־נְעָרִים: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/13","n":"13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יְהַלֲלוּ אֶת־שֵׁם "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְהֹוָה"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" כִּי־נִשְׂגָּב שְׁמוֹ לְבַדּוֹ הוֹדוֹ עַל־אֶרֶץ וְשָׁמָיִם: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/148/14","n":"14"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וַיָּרֶם קֶרֶן לְעַמּוֹ תְּהִלָּה לְכָל־חֲסִידָיו לִבְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל עַם קְרֹבוֹ הַלֲלוּיָהּ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"verse"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
